+{
+  "_comment": "CEO Orchestration — USER ceremony settings (PLAN-122 WS-4). Derived from settings.base.json by REMOVING exactly the 10 governance/sentinel/kernel hooks that block edits or require GPG/sentinel ceremony infra (check_plan_edit, check_arbitration_kernel, check_tier_policy, check_canonical_edit, check_protocol_semver_cascade, check_skill_patch_sentinel, check_scratchpad_access, check_skill_reference_read, check_skill_bootstrap_post, check_bash_canonical_forensic). Every RETAINED entry's BEHAVIORAL fields (matcher/command/timeout) are byte-identical to settings.base.json; some _comment annotations differ (the retained UserPromptSubmit entry carries an added PLAN-122 optimizer note). The advisory/safety scanners AND the UserPromptSubmit optimizer recommender (the whole point of the user profile) are KEPT — none of them block adopter code, and they never need a sentinel or GPG. All hook FILES are still copied to disk by install.sh so validate-governance.sh REQUIRED_FILES are satisfied; the governance subset is simply not registered, so it is dormant for the no-GPG user profile.",
